# The checks, for the core and the Atlas provider alike (tests, lint, types, audit, licenses,
# build, the locks and the Dependabot file): the package's development extra and the tools the
# checks run, each locked with its hashes in dev.txt, at the versions of the image wherever
# both install a dependency. Compiled on the Python of the image, installed on each Python of
# the checks (scripts/lock.sh).
-c image.txt
-e file:.[dev]
check-jsonschema
pip-licenses
pip-tools
